  "summary": "Volve produced 10.04 million Sm3 of oil to end-2016, and two wells made most of it. F-12 produced 4.58 million Sm3 (46%) and F-14 produced 3.94 million Sm3 (39%), together 84.9% of field oil. The next largest, F-11, added 1.15 million Sm3 (11%).",
